FURB103 [*] `open` and `write` should be replaced by `Path("file.txt").write_text(b"\103")`
  --> FURB103_3.py:27:6
   |
25 | # Unsafe fix: the argument does not match the mode, so `open` would truncate the
26 | # file before `write` raises, but `write_text`/`write_bytes` raise first.
27 | with open("file.txt", "w") as f:
   |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
28 |     f.write(b"\103")
   |
help: Replace with `Path("file.txt").write_text(b"\103")`
   |
